<li>Hard2bit, <a href="https://hard2bit.com/en/partners/">cybersecurity partner programme</a>. An adjacent white-label operating model; its own commercial description.</li>
<li>ONEKEY, <a href="https://www.onekey.com/platform-overview">platform overview</a>. Vendor description.</li>
<li>DEKRA, <a href="https://www.dekra.com/en/cyberresilienceact/">CRA services</a>; Bureau Veritas Cybersecurity, <a href="https://cybersecurity.bureauveritas.com/services/iot/industrial">industrial-product testing</a>; TÜV Rheinland, <a href="https://go.tuv.com/cybersecurity-assurance-from-tuv-rheinland?cpid=US21_I07_CYBER_WS_03">Cybersecurity Assurance</a>. First-party service descriptions.</li>
